(7093063, 1079965, 28427, '<td valign="top">What a daredevil: standing on the edge of such a small cabinet.<br/>The overall atmosphere of the photograph gives indeed a very southern feeling.  Especially the flowers of the underwear and the fringes of the scarf against the background of the soft coloured curtain.  I very much like the tattoos :)<br/>One thing I find a shame is the RC, but you''ve got to work with the tools you have so this will certainly not make me downgrade my vote.<br/> <br/>Edit: coming back to this entry... Strangely enough I already feel different about the RC and to be honest: I now see it as a +.  It somehow completes the photograph :)</td>', 'What a daredevil: standing on the edge of such a small cabinet.The overall atmosphere of the photograph gives indeed a very southern feeling.  Especially the flowers of the underwear and the fringes of the scarf against the background of the soft coloured curtain.  I very much like the tattoos :)One thing I find a shame is the RC, but you''ve got to work with the tools you have so this will certainly not make me downgrade my vote. Edit: coming back to this entry... Strangely enough I already feel different about the RC and to be honest: I now see it as a +.  It somehow completes the photograph :)', '2013-08-26 16:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
