(7095573, 1080464, 152252, '<td valign="top">Very artistic entry. Highly underrated. The grain looks very appealing and I like how the tones progress from light in the right lower corner to dark in left upper corner. The three dots in the middle area are very mysterious. Definitely some good stuff! ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-08-30 16:11:41.</i></td>', 'Very artistic entry. Highly underrated. The grain looks very appealing and I like how the tones progress from light in the right lower corner to dark in left upper corner. The three dots in the middle area are very mysterious. Definitely some good stuff! ;)', '2013-08-30 17:09:34.000000', '2013-08-30 17:11:41.000000', 0),
