(7096960, 1080397, 108580, '<td valign="top">Thanks Herman! it had a title of "Hoëveld" but that disappeared on roll over... :( I''ve asked SC to fix it...<br/>Some of my recent entries were taken against the light in winter so they had that typical African Veld brown that I suppose is typical of Amanda''s entries but hey, we both like the same scapes. She just lives in one full time :)</td>', 'Thanks Herman! it had a title of "Hoëveld" but that disappeared on roll over... :( I''ve asked SC to fix it...Some of my recent entries were taken against the light in winter so they had that typical African Veld brown that I suppose is typical of Amanda''s entries but hey, we both like the same scapes. She just lives in one full time :)', '2013-09-02 06:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
